       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-GENEPLORE-TOTIENT.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-GENEPLORE-TOTIENT-PROOFS.
           05  WS-PREINVENTIVE-TOTIENT-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-COMBINE-HOMOMORPHISM-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DECOMPOSE-INVERSE-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-EXPLORATORY-BMRC-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ZERO-GENESIS-GROUND-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTIENT-STRATEGY-SEAL    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-TOTIENT-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-TOTIENT-PROVEN       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-TOTIENT-CODE       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-GENERATIVE-OPS.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-EXPLORATORY-OPS.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-TOTIENT-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-GENERATIVE-OPS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PREINVENTIVE-TOTIENT-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-COMBINE-HOMOMORPHISM-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-EXPLORATORY-OPS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DECOMPOSE-INVERSE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-EXPLORATORY-BMRC-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ZERO-GENESIS-GROUND-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-TOTIENT-PROOFS.
           IF WS-PREINVENTIVE-TOTIENT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-COMBINE-HOMOMORPHISM-OK = 1 AND
              WS-DECOMPOSE-INVERSE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-EXPLORATORY-BMRC-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ZERO-GENESIS-GROUND-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTIENT-STRATEGY-SEAL
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-TOTIENT-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-TOTIENT-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-TOTIENT-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-TOTIENT-CODE.
